  The caption says the bus service 'started' from Gobi, but the article only says the launch ceremony was held at the Gobi bus stand and does not state a stand for the service; the reel_script wording 'நேற்றிரவு கோபி பஸ் ஸ்டாண்டில் துவக்க விழா நடைபெற்றது' is consistent, so this is not an error — however, the caption's '🗓️ நாள்: நேற்று' (yesterday) is a date claim not in the article, which only says the ceremony was 'நேற்றிரவு' (last night).
  The reel_script says the bus 'தினமும் இரவு 7 மணிக்கு புறப்படும்' and the caption repeats this; the article says it departs from Gobi bus stand at 7:00 pm, so this is fine, but the reel_script omits the detail that the Tirupati-to-Gobi bus leaves at 7:30 pm 'தினமும்' — it is included, so no omission.
  The reel_script states the Tirupati-to-Gobi bus 'மறுநாள் அதிகாலை 5:30 மணிக்கு பஸ் கோபியை அடையும்' correctly, but the slides_spec 'லோக்' field 'கோபி, ஈரோடு' adds Erode, which is not stated in the article for the location of the service (only the English caption tag mentions Erode news).
