factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The reel_script and caption state the inspection was conducted 'in Tharapuram' under the Erode district seed inspection deputy director's control, but the article says the area under that director's control is in Tharapuram (Tiruppur district) where the inspection was held; this is consistent, so no issue there.
  The reel_script opens by saying a sales ban was imposed on seeds worth Rs 14 lakh, which matches the article.
  The slides_spec line 'ஈரோடு விதை ஆய்வு துணை இயக்குனர் தலைமையில் சோதனை' implies the Erode deputy director led the inspection personally, while the article says the inspection was led by deputy director Sumathi; the slide and reel_script then mix two different heads of the inspection into one statement, combining two facts into one sentence.
  The caption's 'துறை: ஈரோடு மாவட்ட விதை ஆய்வுத் துறை' and the reel_script's statement that the Erode deputy director controls the area are consistent with the article, so no issue there.
  The slides_spec line 'விதை விற்பனை நடைமுறைகளைக் கடைபிடிக்காவிட்டால் கடும்' is cut mid-phrase and is not a grammatically complete or clearly meaningful Tamil sentence on its own.
  The slides_spec and caption describe the 13 items as 'காய்கறி, நெல் விதை குவியல்கள்' while the article says the seeds were 'குவியல்கள்' of vegetable and paddy seeds; the caption's 'விதை குவியல்களுக்கு' wording is acceptable, so no issue there.
  The caption's 'மக்கள் கவனத்திற்கு' advisory to buy only from shops with proper documents is an invented public advisory not present in the article.
